flowchart TD
    A[main.py starts job] --> B[Run Scrapy Spider]
    B --> C[Log events to console & file]
    C --> D[Job completes or fails]
    D --> E[Build jobs list + record count]
    E --> F[Call send_email(jobs, record_count)]
    F --> G[Build HTML + plain email report]
    G --> H[Connect to SMTP server]
    H --> I[Authenticate & send email]
    I --> J[Recipients receive report]
